BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:🗓️ Your November at a glance
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
DTSTAMP:20261002T122347Z
UID:5613a23e8a7e2b4c6b4fadfc@jentm1-arch.github.io/calendario-astral
DESCRIPTION:November is about finishing what October stirred up. Venus and
  Mercury both turn direct — Venus on the 11th\, Mercury on the 13th — 
 closing a long season of reviewing partnerships and shared resources\, you
 r houses of 'us' (7) and deep bonds (8). Don't rush: both planets re-walk 
 their retrograde degrees afterward\, so true clarity on agreements and mon
 ey matters arrives gradually through the month. Meanwhile Uranus hits your
  Mercury exactly on the 13th — a flash of insight or an unexpected conve
 rsation that shakes how you think or earn. Mars conjuncts itself on the 7t
 h\, charging your creative house 5 just as Jupiter sits there too\, growin
 g confidence and opportunity. The new moon in Scorpio (9th) asks for inten
 tions around intimacy and shared finances\; the full moon in Gemini (24th)
  lands on your Sun's money house\, reviewing what you value. Saturn keeps 
 pressing your identity and emotional foundations in the background — slo
 w\, serious work on becoming more solid. → What agreement or truth\, onc
 e Mercury and Venus settle\, are you finally ready to make official?\n\nYo
 u will find more information and detail in the events of November in your 
 calendar. Happy November! ✨\n\n—\n✨ Iris Calendar\n🍯 Updated on 0
 2 Oct 2026\nhttps://mi-calendario-astral.netlify.app
