 gan at the New Moon of Oct 10 comes full circle. Reread the intention you 
 wrote: what has blossomed? what do you release? what do you adjust?\n\n—
  New start for your closest bonds\nThis New Moon lands in your house of pa
 rtnerships\, squaring your natal Moon and opposing your natal Venus — a 
 strong call to look honestly at how you balance your own emotional needs a
 nd values against what a relationship asks of you. Venus\, ruler of this M
 oon\, sits right there too\, retrograde\, asking you to revisit old relati
 onal patterns before setting anything new. Try: 'I commit to naming what I
  need from my closest relationships\,' 'I commit to choosing partners who 
 reflect my true values\,' or 'I commit to balancing my emotions with my co
 mmitments.' Revisit this intention at the Full Moon in Libra on 2027-03-22
 . → Which relationship truly reflects who you are becoming?\n\n—\n✨ 
